# An action a controller takes from a concern it includes is still the
# controller's action: a route to `reports#export` reaches
# `Exportable#export`. Routes were matched only to methods whose owner is
# named `…Controller`, so the concern's routed action was `unreferenced`,
# clear; its unrouted one stays so.
# The path is a string: a `:export` symbol is itself counted (DEC-340).
dead app/controllers/concerns/exportable.rb Exportable#export=convention-only Exportable#forgotten_export=unreferenced~
